sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as tapo_view.py
    participant Acct as Account server
    participant Cipc as cipc API
    participant Relay as Relay :443
    participant FF as ffplay

    App->>Acct: saved token, or login
    App->>Acct: service URL for cipc.api.cloud
    App->>Cipc: POST /v2/relay/request
    Cipc-->>App: relay host and relayToken
    App->>Relay: POST /relayservice, huge Content-Length
    Relay-->>App: HTTP 200, socket stays open
    App->>Relay: preview envelope
    Relay-->>App: JSON session, then video envelopes
    App->>FF: MPEG-TS bytes only
    loop every 25 video parts
        App->>Relay: stream_sequence ack
    end
    loop every 20 seconds
        App->>Relay: heartbeat
    end
